|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB
                        MONK FIGHTING FORMS
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'The power to challenge ones beliefs lies within us all, only
when we awaken it do we truly advance.'|WK0 - |RKBMaster Shal Wei
|YK0
Monks are highly capable fighters and can change their fighting
stance to accomodate different fighting situations. There are 8
forms available and some powers are only usable when that form
has been activated.

Further details on each form are found under the helpfile for the
creature.

The |GKBmonkforms |YK0command provides current cost and levels at 
which each respective form is achieved. As well as the command
syntax.

|YK0All forms can be ceased by utilizing the |GKBEndform |YK0command.

|YK0These forms are: |GKBRat|YK0, |GKBSpider|YK0, |GKBMonkey|YK0, |GKBSnake|YK0, |GKBCrane|YK0,
|GKBTiger|YK0, |GKBPhoenix|YK0 and |GKBDragon|YK0.
|YK0
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
